# Wave T27 (Mistford kit): plankfloor — Mistford's registered street
# kind (the fleet's street kinds carry the -floor suffix; the
# desire-path tiers key on it). Salt-bleached boardwalk planks: long
# horizontal boards, butt joints offset between planks, sparse knots
# and one worn teal paint remnant — the island's street fabric from
# the Centre north jetty to the east surf road. Structurally long
# planks + seams, not a recolour: Copperton's are big square quarry
# flags, Redwood's gravel speckle, Cinder's small brick, the marble
# and sett slabs are stone. Planks read as pier timber at screenshot
# scale. (NO-SAME-KIT law.)
